  3 | 5                     | ERROR: cannot call jsonb_to_recordset on a non-array
  4 | true                  | ERROR: cannot call jsonb_to_recordset on a non-array
  5 | [{"kind": "a"}, 2]    | ERROR: argument of jsonb_to_recordset must be an array of objects
  6 | [{"kind": "a"}, "s"]  | ERROR: argument of jsonb_to_recordset must be an array of objects
  7 | [{"kind": "a"}, null] | ERROR: argument of jsonb_to_recordset must be an array of objects
